index dfb9d3d..b407c8c 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -6,8 +6,12 @@ A small client and CLI for the items API.
 
 ```text
 python3 -m pkg list
+python3 -m pkg --retries 5 list
 ```
 
+`--retries` sets how many times each request is attempted when the server
+returns a 5xx error (default 3).
+
 Run the tests with `python3 -m unittest`.
 
